msgstr "Диапазонът за осредняване."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The range to average. If not included, criteria_range is used for the "
"average instead."
msgstr ""
"Диапазонът за осредняване. Ако не е включен, вместо това за осредняване се "
"използва criteria_range."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range to be summed, if different from range."
msgstr "Диапазонът за сумиране, ако е различен от range."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range to be transposed."
msgstr "Диапазонът за транспониране."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range to check against criterion."
msgstr "Диапазонът за проверка спрямо criterion."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range to check against criterion1."
msgstr "Диапазонът за проверка спрямо criterion1."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The range to consider for the search. Should be a single column or a single "
"row."
msgstr ""
"Диапазонът, който да се вземе предвид при търсенето. Трябва да е една колона "
"или един ред."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The range to consider for the search. The first column in the range is "
"searched for the key specified in search_key."
msgstr ""
"Диапазонът, който да се вземе предвид при търсенето. В първата колона на "
"диапазона се търси ключът, зададен в search_key."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The range to consider for the search. The first row in the range is searched "
"for the key specified in search_key."
msgstr ""
"Диапазонът, който да се вземе предвид при търсенето. В първия ред на "
"диапазона се търси ключът, зададен в search_key."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range to constrain."
msgstr "Диапазонът за ограничаване."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range to sum."
msgstr "Диапазонът за сумиране."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range to wrap."
msgstr "Диапазонът за пренасяне."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range which is tested against criterion."
msgstr "Диапазонът, който се проверява спрямо criterion."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range whose column count will be returned."
msgstr "Диапазонът, чийто брой колони ще бъде върнат."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The range whose row count will be returned."
msgstr "Диапазонът, чийто брой редове ще бъде върнат."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rank from largest to smallest of the element to return."
msgstr "Рангът от най-голям до най-малък на елемента, който да се върне."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rank from smallest to largest of the element to return."
msgstr "Рангът от най-малък до най-голям на елемента, който да се върне."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rate (%s) must be positive or null."
msgstr "Лихвеният процент (%s) трябва да е положителен или нула."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rate (%s) must be strictly positive."
msgstr "Лихвеният процент (%s) трябва да е строго положителен."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rate at which the investment grows each period."
msgstr "Процентът, с който инвестицията нараства всеки период."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rate_guess (%s) must be strictly greater than -1."
msgstr "rate_guess (%s) трябва да е строго по-голям от -1."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The redemption (%s) must be strictly positive."
msgstr "redemption (%s) трябва да е строго положителен."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The redemption amount per 100 face value, or par."
msgstr "Сумата за погасяване на 100 номинална стойност, или номинал."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The reference to the cell."
msgstr "Референцията към клетката."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The regular expression pattern to match against the text."
msgstr "Шаблонът на регулярния израз за съвпадение спрямо текста."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The result_range must be a single row or a single column."
msgstr "result_range трябва да е един ред или една колона."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The return (as a percentage) earned on reinvestment of income received from "
"the investment."
msgstr ""
"Възвръщаемостта (като процент), получена от реинвестиране на доходите от "
"инвестицията."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The return_mode (%s) must be 0, 1 or 2."
msgstr "return_mode (%s) трябва да е 0, 1 или 2."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The returned value if condition1 is TRUE."
msgstr "Върнатата стойност, ако condition1 е TRUE."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The row index of the value to be returned, where the first row in range is "
"numbered 1."
msgstr ""
"Индексът на реда на стойността, която да се върне, където първият ред в "
"диапазона е номериран с 1."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The row number of the cell reference. "
msgstr "Номерът на реда на референцията към клетката. "

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rows argument (%s) must be strictly positive."
msgstr "Аргументът rows (%s) трябва да е строго положителен."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The rows arguments (%s) must be greater or equal than the number of rows of "
"the array."
msgstr ""
"Аргументите rows (%s) трябва да са по-големи или равни на броя редове на "
"масива."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rows arguments must be between -%s and %s (got %s), excluding 0."
msgstr "Аргументите rows трябва да са между -%s и %s (получено %s), без 0."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rows indexes of the rows to be returned."
msgstr "Индексите на редовете, които да се върнат."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rule is invalid for an unknown reason"
msgstr "Правилото е невалидно по неизвестна причина"

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The rule is invalid for an unknown reason."
msgstr "Правилото е невалидно по неизвестна причина."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The salvage (%(salvage)s) must be smaller or equal than the cost (%(cost)s)."
msgstr ""
"salvage (%(salvage)s) трябва да е по-малък или равен на cost (%(cost)s)."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The salvage (%s) must be positive or null."
msgstr "salvage (%s) трябва да е положителен или нула."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The sample covariance of a dataset."
msgstr "Извадковата ковариация на набор от данни."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The search and match mode combination is not supported for XLOOKUP "
"evaluation."
msgstr ""
"Комбинацията от режим на търсене и съвпадение не се поддържа при оценка на "
"XLOOKUP."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The search method is a number 1, 0 or -1 indicating which value to return. 1 "
"finds the largest value less than or equal to search_key when range is "
"sorted in ascending order. 0 finds the exact value when range is unsorted. "
"-1 finds the smallest value greater than or equal to search_key when range "
"is sorted in descending order."
msgstr ""
"Методът на търсене е число 1, 0 или -1, указващо коя стойност да се върне. 1 "
"намира най-голямата стойност, по-малка или равна на search_key, когато "
"диапазонът е сортиран във възходящ ред. 0 намира точната стойност, когато "
"диапазонът не е сортиран. -1 намира най-малката стойност, по-голяма или "
"равна на search_key, когато диапазонът е сортиран в низходящ ред."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The second addend."
msgstr "Второто събираемо."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The second argument is missing. Please provide a value"
msgstr "Вторият аргумент липсва. Моля, въведете стойност"

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The second component of the time."
msgstr "Секундният компонент на часа."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The second matrix in the matrix multiplication operation."
msgstr "Втората матрица в операцията за матрично умножение."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The second multiplicand."
msgstr "Вторият множител."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The second number to compare."
msgstr "Второто число за сравнение."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The second string to compare."
msgstr "Вторият низ за сравнение."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The second value must be a number"
msgstr "Втората стойност трябва да е число"

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The second value."
msgstr "Втората стойност."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The settlement date (%(settlement)s) must at most one year after the "
"maturity date (%(maturity)s)."
msgstr ""
"Датата на сетълмент (%(settlement)s) трябва да е най-много една година след "
"падежната дата (%(maturity)s)."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The settlement date (%(settlement)s) must be greater or equal to the issue "
"date (%(issue)s)."
msgstr ""
"Датата на сетълмент (%(settlement)s) трябва да е по-голяма или равна на "
"датата на емисия (%(issue)s)."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The settlement date (%(settlement)s) must be strictly greater than the issue "
"date (%(issue)s)."
msgstr ""
"Датата на сетълмент (%(settlement)s) трябва да е строго по-голяма от датата "
"на емисия (%(issue)s)."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The settlement date of the security, the date after issuance when the "
"security is delivered to the buyer."
msgstr ""
"Датата на сетълмент на ценната книга, датата след емитирането, когато "
"ценната книга се доставя на купувача."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The sheet name cannot be empty."
msgstr "Името на листа не може да е празно."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The single period within life for which to calculate depreciation."
msgstr "Единичният период от живота, за който да се изчисли амортизацията."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The source text."
msgstr "Изходният текст."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid ""
"The start date of the period from which to calculate the number of net "
"working days."
msgstr ""
"Началната дата на периода, от който да се изчисли броят нетни работни дни."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
msgid "The start date to consider in the calculation."
msgstr "Началната дата, която да се вземе предвид при изчислението."

#. module: spreadsheet
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet/o_spreadsheet.js:0
